1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:02,171
Now the body is gone.

2
00:00:03,996 --> 00:00:04,976
Are you gone?

3
00:00:06,031 --> 00:00:07,320
What remains?

4
00:00:09,875 --> 00:00:11,843
No need to locate yourself.

5
00:00:13,279 --> 00:00:16,195
Let experience unfold on its own.

6
00:00:19,629 --> 00:00:21,781
Now the bodies are dissolved.

7
00:00:23,409 --> 00:00:25,695
Just rest in the experience.

8
00:00:27,190 --> 00:00:29,624
There is no body to hold onto.

9
00:00:30,629 --> 00:00:32,621
Whatever appears:

10
00:00:32,645 --> 00:00:33,957
sound,

11
00:00:33,981 --> 00:00:35,113
light,

12
00:00:35,137 --> 00:00:36,457
sensation,

13
00:00:37,487 --> 00:00:39,562
let it come and go by itself.

14
00:00:40,822 --> 00:00:42,445
Nothing to hold.

15
00:00:43,013 --> 00:00:45,015
Nothing to push away.

